---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Servare Opus takes responsibility for complex, ambiguous operational work for physician-owned healthcare practices and founder-led companies — not task management."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Servare Opus</h1>
      <p>Executive support built on a simple idea: most CEOs share the same problems.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>Servare Opus takes responsibility for complex, ambiguous operational work — not task management.</p>

      <h2>How We Work</h2>
      <p>Every engagement starts the same way: understand the problem, identify the missing information and stakeholders, build the structure the situation requires, and carry it to resolution.</p>

      <h2>Who We Serve</h2>
      <p>Physician-owned healthcare practices navigating clinical systems, credentialing, and regulatory complexity, and founder-led companies that need operational infrastructure to scale without breaking.</p>

      <h2>Discretion</h2>
      <p>Operations work touches sensitive financial, employee, and business information. Every engagement is handled with the confidentiality that requires.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Ready to get some of your week back?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--gray); max-width:520px; margin: 0 auto 28px;">Start with a no-pressure discovery call. We'll talk through where your time is going and whether we're a fit.</p>
      <a href="/booking" class="btn">Book a Discovery Call</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
